# SM8350 XNU patch series.
#
# sheng-platform-power is the shared AMFI/PMGR hook: it calls sheng_pmgr_run()
# from bsd_init when XNU_SHENG_PMGR=1, and the device package supplies that
# symbol (a provider-less ApplePMGRNub plus the touch bring-up).
#
# It lives in patches/xnu/ of the architecture repository too, but the SM8350
# config and board.toml both set CONFIG_XNU_SHENG_PMGR=y, so a copy is vendored
# here: a series that names a patch it does not carry is a broken series, and
# `unixnu status` is right to refuse it.
sheng-platform-power.patch
